                "word": "quittement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1d81c2b8-ceec-32b0-8128-2c577bf3a8c7",
                        "entry_id": "d3fb0405-6a68-33a3-9476-48b59483d50b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Avec exemption de toutes charges, dettes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "note": "il ne s’emploie qu’avec le mot franchement",
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2eff6d4-aa87-4869-8f8e-8e7579e0390d",
                                "sense_id": "1d81c2b8-ceec-32b0-8128-2c577bf3a8c7",
                                "text": "La stipulation de reprise est une clause apposée dans un contrat de mariage, par laquelle il est porté que la femme, au cas qu'elle renonce à la communauté, reprendra franchement et quittement tout ce qu'elle aura mis dans ladite communauté."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c8763cf-f889-4cc1-88df-f17f068edce9",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3fb0405-6a68-33a3-9476-48b59483d50b",
                        "source_sense_id": "1d81c2b8-ceec-32b0-8128-2c577bf3a8c7",
                        "target_lang_word": "free and clear",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "free and clear",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3adce99a-dda9-3399-86b8-fecab0f752cd",
                                        "entry_id": "f61e9b4a-4511-3de4-8e1c-1d1ca537103c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a condition of lawful outright ownership, without restrictions or encumbrances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a33355-0c67-4640-9728-2ff4bb58ce60",
                                                "sense_id": "3adce99a-dda9-3399-86b8-fecab0f752cd",
                                                "text": "I have been trying to get a free and clear title to the land for a client of mine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f9eb644-7b51-4f79-af73-59ce632e1858",
                                                "sense_id": "3adce99a-dda9-3399-86b8-fecab0f752cd",
                                                "text": "[T]hey cannot at once name a dozen in the town who own their farms free and clear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ec344bc-9910-4500-9013-1d41b6f30bfb",
                                                "sense_id": "3adce99a-dda9-3399-86b8-fecab0f752cd",
                                                "text": "The will might stipulate, for example, that the heir receive the home, free and clear, Ms. Wheatley-Liss said, which may mean that the executor will be directed to sell stocks, bonds or other assets in the estate to pay off the mortgage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0aea51aa-f117-3b1b-b4f0-82530fdf49ca",
                                        "entry_id": "f61e9b4a-4511-3de4-8e1c-1d1ca537103c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Possessing such lawful outright ownership."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9602a5f-0b29-45a9-a632-8ef1f512e7b3",
                                                "sense_id": "0aea51aa-f117-3b1b-b4f0-82530fdf49ca",
                                                "text": "I made the last payment on the house today. . . . We’re free and clear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b9759ed-ce12-4ccd-a262-9245087038dd",
                                                "sense_id": "0aea51aa-f117-3b1b-b4f0-82530fdf49ca",
                                                "text": "Though standard in real estate transactions, the concept of title insurance, which guarantees that a seller is the free and clear owner, has been resisted by the art world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
